<p>You are able to target your throwing knives with pinpoint accuracy, increasing their critical strike chance by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3%, 7%, 10%, 12%, 14%</acronym> and critical strike damage by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">7%, 11%, 14%, 17%, 20%.</acronym> </p><p>In addition, your critical strikes with throwing knives have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">16%, 25%, 31%, 36%, 40%</acronym> chance to randomly disable your target, possibly disarming, silencing or pinning them for 2 turns.</p>